        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "892af805-25ca-5528-bcbf-5f711a953a1e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ritesh Sidhwani, Farhan Akhtar, Karan Anshuman, Kumud Mishra, Aamir Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Preity Zinta, Sonali Kulkarni, Dimple Kapadia, Riteish Deshmukh, Pulkit Samrat, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Akshay Kumar\n- Companies: Excel Entertainment Pvt. Ltd.\n- Films: Dil Chahta Hai, Bangistan, Filmistaan, Revolver Rani, Jolly LLB 2, Raanjhanaa, Badlapur, Airlift\n- Roles: Sanjeev Kohli\n\nFacts:\n- Ritesh Sidhwani, born in 1973, is a Bollywood film producer who founded Excel Entertainment Pvt. Ltd.\n- Ritesh Sidhwani and his long-time friend Farhan Akhtar made Dil Chahta Hai as the first film under the Excel Entertainment banner.\n- Dil Chahta Hai is a 2001 Indian comedy-drama film starring Aamir Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Preity Zinta, Sonali Kulkarni, and Dimple Kapadia.\n- Bangistan is a 2015 Bollywood comedy satire film directed by Karan Anshuman and produced by Farhan Akhtar and Ritesh Sidhwani.\n- Bangistan stars Riteish Deshmukh, Pulkit Samrat, and Chandan Roy Sanyal in the lead roles.\n- Kumud Mishra has acted in Filmistaan, Revolver Rani, Jolly LLB 2, Raanjhanaa, Badlapur, Bangistan, and Airlift.\n- In Airlift, Kumud Mishra played the substantial role of Sanjeev Kohli.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
